  "name": "WF-01  Product & Sales Data Ingestion",
  "description": "Ingests product and sales data from the frontend via POST webhook. Cleans input fields, checks for existing products in Supabase, then creates or updates the product row accordingly. Called by the React frontend's AddProductModal and CsvImportModal.",
